{"publicId":"ad09287f-1095-44f0-a79b-3117e1aedc29","title":"Nvidia调整新加坡收入统计标准引发税务争议","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T20:34:18.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-17T20:34:18.000Z","digest":"Nvidia将新加坡部分收入重新归类至美国，因2026年11月18日生效的销售地域划分标准从客户发票地址改为总部所在地【新】。调整依据称需避免双重征税，但未明确芯片最终运行地（早先报道未提及该细节）。早前2024年财报显示新加坡贡献104亿美元收入，按新标准计算该地区收入占比或下降，可能影响新加坡企业税负评估【旧】。目前争议焦点在于：1）芯片实际使用地与发票地是否一致；2）美国税法是否适用于非美国企业海外收入。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-17T21:39:56.615Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Nvidia 调整销售地域划分标准","latestReport":{"id":"n9hh0x9xazwhglv66qhiyxl53"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":1,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fw1Vj10zs-Ik","title":"Nvidia Singapore Revenue","firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T20:34:18.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"n9hh0x9xazwhglv66qhiyxl53","title":"Nvidia 调整销售地域划分标准","summary":"Nvidia 将地理销售细分标准从客户发票地址改为总部所在地，但未明确芯片最终运行地。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T20:34:18.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"n9hh0x9xazwhglv66qhiyxl53","title":"Nvidia 调整销售地域划分标准","summary":"Nvidia 将地理销售细分标准从客户发票地址改为总部所在地，但未明确芯片最终运行地。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T20:34:18.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-17T22:00:00.000Z","heat":9.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T23:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","heat":9.1,"participants":1}],"related":[],"topics":[{"slug":"nvidia","name":"NVIDIA / 英伟达"},{"slug":"earnings","name":"财报"}]}